      "value": "SS49E",
      "pos": [
        30,
        0
      ],
      "rot": 0,
      "footprint": "TO-92_inline",
      "custom": {
        "name": "SS49E",
        "prefix": "U",
        "pins": [
          {
            "number": "1",
            "name": "+VS",
            "side": "top"
          },
          {
            "number": "2",
            "name": "GND",
            "side": "bottom"
          },
          {
            "number": "3",
            "name": "VOUT",
            "side": "right"
          },
          {
            "number": "B",
            "name": "B",
            "side": "left",
            "sim_only": true
          }
        ],
        "sim": {
          "kind": "subckt",
          "element": "",
          "name": "SS49E",
          "text": ".subckt SS49E vs gnd out b\n* B pin: 1 V = 100 G. Ratiometric: Vs/2 + (Vs/5) * 1.4 mV/G * B, kept 0.2 V inside the supply\nRb b 0 100Meg\nRiq vs gnd 830\nBh h gnd V=limit(V(vs,gnd)/2+0.028*V(vs,gnd)*V(b),0.2,V(vs,gnd)-0.2)*step(V(vs,gnd)-2.5,0.2)\nRo h out 1\n.ends SS49E",
          "pins": [
            "1",
            "2",
            "3",
            "B"
          ],
          "params": {},
          "limits": [
            "シミュレーション専用ピン(基板には出ません)。電圧源をつなぎ、その電圧で磁束密度 [G] (1V = 100G, 正負あり。極性で出力が上下)を与えます。つながないと 0 として扱います。",
            "感度は電源電圧に比例(レシオメトリック)です。温度ドリフト・オフセット誤差・ノイズ・応答速度は扱いません。",
            "実物は ±650G 付近で出力が飽和します。このモデルは電源の 0.2V 内側で飽和します。"
          ]
        },
        "ratings": {
          "v_max": 10.0,
          "rows": [
            {
              "name": "感度",
              "value": "1.4mV/G",
              "condition": "Vs = 5V"
            },
            {
              "name": "ゼロ磁界出力",
              "value": "Vs/2 (2.5V)",
              "condition": "Vs = 5V"
            },
            {
              "name": "電源電流",
              "value": "6mA (代表)",
              "condition": "Vs = 5V"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
